m{ZfcTop2NetConvergence}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}net\\text{-}convergence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2NetConvergence}_S(x_\\bullet,x,D,\\leq_D,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelDirectedSet}_S(D,\\leq_D)\\land x\\in X\\land x_\\bullet\\in X^D\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\Bigl(x\\in U\\to\\exists d_0\\in D\\;\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d_0,d\\rangle\\in\\leq_D\\to x_\\bullet(d)\\in U)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}net\\text{-}convergence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2NetConvergence}_S(x_\\bullet,x,D,\\leq_D,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelDirectedSet}_S(D,\\leq_D)\\land x\\in X\\land x_\\bullet\\in X^D\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\Bigl(x\\in U\\to\\exists d_0\\in D\\;\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d_0,d\\rangle\\in\\leq_D\\to x_\\bullet(d)\\in U)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-rel-directed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f6ab9827c296452","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-rel-directed-set.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x_\\bullet,x,D,\\leq_D,X,\\tau,U,d_0,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{T